{"id":"2a3b5d1c6d48163f","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-canonical-simple-set.md","title":"具有基数界 e 的规范简单集","display":"thm-canonical-simple-set — 具有基数界 e 的规范简单集","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-canonical-simple-set","aliases":["20-thm-canonical-simple-set"],"display":"thm-canonical-simple-set — 具有基数界 e 的规范简单集","chapter":"5","section":"5.2.2","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 5.2.5；式 (5.4) 的局部边界修正","source_printed_pages":[110],"source_pdf_pages":[145],"depends_on":["[[20-df-effective-simple]]","[[20-df-movable-markers]]","[[20-df-stages]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-canonical-simple-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-canonical-simple-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-canonical-simple-set — 具有基数界 e 的规范简单集"},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"section","html":"5.2.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 5.2.5；式 (5.4) 的局部边界修正"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>110</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>145</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3ec173dab9734388\" href=\"?note=3ec173dab9734388\" title=\"20-df-effective-simple\">20-df-effective-simple</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"466c9d0fec2ff1b3\" href=\"?note=466c9d0fec2ff1b3\" title=\"20-df-movable-markers\">20-df-movable-markers</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{e,s}\">\\(W_{e,s}\\)</span> 为统一阶段枚举；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_s\">\\(A_s\\)</span> 为待构造递增有限集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_i(s)\">\\(a_i(s)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\setminus A_s\">\\(\\omega\\setminus A_s\\)</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i+1\">\\(i+1\\)</span> 小成员；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EffectivelySimple}\">\\(\\operatorname{EffectivelySimple}\\)</span> 采用非严格基数界。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3ec173dab9734388\" href=\"?note=3ec173dab9734388\" title=\"20-df-effective-simple\">20-df-effective-simple</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"466c9d0fec2ff1b3\" href=\"?note=466c9d0fec2ff1b3\" title=\"20-df-movable-markers\">20-df-movable-markers</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}canonical-simple-set}\\vdash\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{EffectivelySimple}(A)\\land\n\\forall e\\ (W_e\\subseteq\\omega\\setminus A\\Rightarrow |W_e|\\le e)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}canonical-simple-set}\\vdash\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{EffectivelySimple}(A)\\land\n\\forall e\\ (W_e\\subseteq\\omega\\setminus A\\Rightarrow |W_e|\\le e)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+1\">\\(s+1\\)</span> 选最小 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e&lt;s\">\\(e&lt;s\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{e,s}\\cap A_s=\\varnothing\">\\(W_{e,s}\\cap A_s=\\varnothing\\)</span> 且某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\ge e\">\\(i\\ge e\\)</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_i(s)\\in W_{e,s}\">\\(a_i(s)\\in W_{e,s}\\)</span>；把最小这样的标记放入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>。每个要求至多行动一次。</p>\n<p>归纳 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的标记稳定性。低于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的标记最终稳定后，只有要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\le n\">\\(e\\le n\\)</span> 的行动能直接删除第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个标记；它们总共至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> 次，高位删除不影响该标记。因此每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_n(s)\">\\(a_n(s)\\)</span> 收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_n\">\\(a_n\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_0&lt;a_1&lt;\\cdots\">\\(a_0&lt;a_1&lt;\\cdots\\)</span> 全在最终补集中，故补集无限。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\\subseteq\\omega\\setminus A\">\\(W_e\\subseteq\\omega\\setminus A\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|W_e|&gt;e\">\\(|W_e|&gt;e\\)</span>，有一个最终成员 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_i\\in W_e\">\\(a_i\\in W_e\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\ge e\">\\(i\\ge e\\)</span>。等待该标记稳定、成员出现以及所有较小要求最后行动后，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 必行动，矛盾。于是所示基数界成立，也蕴含简单性。</p>\n<p>原书 PDF 145 的式 (5.4) 写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&gt;e\">\\(i&gt;e\\)</span>，末段验证却以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\ge e\">\\(i\\ge e\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|W_e|&gt;e\">\\(|W_e|&gt;e\\)</span> 为依据。仅从严格版本的策略可直接保证的是界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e+1\">\\(e+1\\)</span>。本条把行动条件改为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\ge e\">\\(i\\ge e\\)</span>，保留定理宣称的界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>；原书前一行稳定性验证的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e&lt;n\">\\(e&lt;n\\)</span> 同步改成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\le n\">\\(e\\le n\\)</span>。有限伤害归纳仍成立。此处记录提供 PDF 内部的边界差异和本地可证修正，不声称作者已确认勘误。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 110 / PDF 145；已核对页面图像。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-effective-simple","status":"resolved","id":"3ec173dab9734388","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-effective-simple]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-movable-markers","status":"resolved","id":"466c9d0fec2ff1b3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-movable-markers]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-effective-simple","status":"resolved","id":"3ec173dab9734388","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-effective-simple]]；see [[20-df-movable-markers]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-movable-markers","status":"resolved","id":"466c9d0fec2ff1b3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-effective-simple]]；see [[20-df-movable-markers]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-effective-simple]]；see [[20-df-movable-markers]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"W_{e,s}","display":false},{"tex":"A_s","display":false},{"tex":"a_i(s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\setminus A_s","display":false},{"tex":"i+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EffectivelySimple}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}canonical-simple-set}\\vdash\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{EffectivelySimple}(A)\\land\n\\forall e\\ (W_e\\subseteq\\omega\\setminus A\\Rightarrow |W_e|\\le e)].","display":true},{"tex":"s+1","display":false},{"tex":"e<s","display":false},{"tex":"W_{e,s}\\cap A_s=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"i\\ge e","display":false},{"tex":"a_i(s)\\in W_{e,s}","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"e\\le n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n+1","display":false},{"tex":"a_n(s)","display":false},{"tex":"a_n","display":false},{"tex":"a_0<a_1<\\cdots","display":false},{"tex":"W_e\\subseteq\\omega\\setminus A","display":false},{"tex":"|W_e|>e","display":false},{"tex":"a_i\\in W_e","display":false},{"tex":"i\\ge e","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"i>e","display":false},{"tex":"i\\ge e","display":false},{"tex":"|W_e|>e","display":false},{"tex":"e+1","display":false},{"tex":"i\\ge e","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"e<n","display":false},{"tex":"e\\le n","display":false}],"bytes":2406,"backlinks":[{"id":"3dd3a38d0a4f5c6c","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-simple]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-df-sigma-complete]]；see [[20-df-movable-markers]]；see [[20-thm-cof-complexity]]；see [[20-thm-canonical-simple-set]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]。"}],"outgoing":["3ec173dab9734388","466c9d0fec2ff1b3","4ef1aee16db6b308"]}